  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Gender Country Program Plan 2023-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiji Gender Country Program Plan from 1 July 2023 to 31 December 2028 5.	Gender Activities are now delivered through the new Pacific Women Lead program (PWL 2020 &#x2013; 2026 INN604) and bilaterally a new Fiji Gender Country Program Plan (2023-2028) has been developed following consultations with partners.  Partners in Fiji include the Ministry for Women, Children and Poverty Alleviation (MWCPA), Diverse Voices for Action for Equality, femLINKpacific, Fiji Women&#x2019;s Crisis Centre, the Women&#x2019;s Fund Fiji, UN Women, UNICEF, the Pacific Community, and International Women&#x2019;s Development Agency. These partners are engaged through a variety of approaches including core funding, grants, provision of technical advisers and capacity building.</narrative>
  </description>
